# Test Approach

## Scope
Only the Random Date Generator tool was tested.

## Assumptions
- The tool generates random dates within the selected range.
- The number inputted should accept only reasonable number values
- The UI should remain responsive and readable.

## Testing Techniques Used 

- Functional Testing 
- Boundary Value Analysis(BVA)
- Equivalent Partitioning(EP)
- Stress Testing 
- Cross-Browser testing
- Exploratory Testing

## Browser Testing 

- Microsoft Edge(Latest)
- Mozilla Firefox(Latest)
